@ 0 7 0 00691563a92a0cf21a5ecc641dd2e7f3
+         row  `Unexpected(message)`  2  _the server sent an unexpected message `message`_  incluido `3` para `SSH_MSG_UNIMPLEMENTED`: el servidor no entendió algo que envió este cliente
+         row  `NoCommonAlgorithm(kind)`  3  _the server offers no supported `kind` algorithm_  `key exchange`, `host key` o `cipher`
+         row  `HostKeyRejected(keyType)`  4  _the server's `keyType` host key was not accepted_  la política `Ssh.HostKeys` rechazó la clave
+         row  `BadSignature`  5  _the server's signature over the exchange is wrong_  la firma de la clave de host sobre el hash de intercambio no se pudo verificar
+         row  `Disconnected(code, text)`  6  _the server disconnected with code `code`: `text`_  el servidor envió `SSH_MSG_DISCONNECT`
+         row  `ClosedConnection`  7  _the connection was closed_  el socket se cerró a mitad de un mensaje
+         row  `Integrity`  8  _a packet failed its integrity check_  su comprobación AEAD

